# Local run history and other runtime state.
#
# The run history is written to `<repo root>/.muca/runs` by default (see
# `src/store/run-history.ts`). The repository root `.gitignore` is owned by
# the coordinator, so this file covers the same path from this app's side
# as a belt-and-braces measure: the runtime state must never be committed.
.muca/
